{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The digital caliper fits my recent purchases of nails, screws and anchors because it would help me check dimensions when matching fasteners.",
    "The epoxy feels like a useful next choice because bonding small repairs complements the fastening supplies I have been buying."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Printer filament requires a printing task that my recent purchases do not suggest; buying repair hardware does not give me a reason to use it.",
    "Different filament colors and materials do not make those items more useful to me right now, and large spools would leave me with supplies I have no current use for."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The suggestions seem to treat hands-on construction work and 3D printing as interchangeable interests, even though they require different supplies.",
    "The repeated filament suggestions seem to assume an interest in printing that I have not shown."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated purchases of nails, screws and anchors point toward fastening and mounting tasks where dimensions and compatibility matter.",
    "My vacuum bags and other supplies suggest practical maintenance needs; a recommendation feels relevant when I can connect it to a specific repair or replacement task."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The caliper and epoxy fit my practical repair needs, but most suggestions incorrectly extend that interest to 3D printing."
}"}
